{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o038a","title":"散骑常侍乂谏帝节骑乘循礼复古","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o038a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"散骑常侍乂谏帝节骑乘循礼复古","evidence":["shaodi-e-o038a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0021","role":"进谏","evidence":["shaodi-e-o038a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":247,"label":"冬十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y247","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o035","basis":"冬十二月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o038a-q","shaodi-q-o035","shaodi-q-b-b28fac78df16482bf878"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o038a-q","source_order":[4,149,"O038a"],"order":1046}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0021","name":"孔乂","evidence":["shaodi-q-o038","shaodi-identity-note-9"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o038-shaodi-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o038"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o038a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3bbeae9cc7c166f78514","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，散骑常侍、谏议大夫乂奏曰〖17〗：“礼：天子之宫，有斫砻之制〖18〗，无朱丹之饰。宜循礼复古。今天下已平，君臣之分明〖19〗。陛下但当不懈于位，平公正之心，审赏罚以使之。可绝后园习骑乘马，出必御辇乘车：天下之福，臣子之愿也。”晏、乂咸因缺以进规谏〖20〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133},{"id":"shaodi-identity-note-9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-113088b63ec580eef8a0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗谏议大夫：官名。负责向皇帝进谏。孔乂：事见本书卷十六《仓慈传》裴注引《孔氏谱》。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-58646bbaafd4b7644664","start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-b28fac78df16482bf878","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b28fac78df16482bf878","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗八年：正始八年（公元 247）。1956 年河南省洛阳市涧西区曾发现正始八年曹魏墓葬，出土了极其精美的白玉杯、带有“正始八年”字样的帷帐铁架等器物。白玉杯现藏河南洛阳市博物馆。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":154,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-36d7289d4fc3e06d3183","start":0,"end":91},{"id":"shaodi-q-o035","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7a58be9723bf49d1ec80","layer":"original","quote":"八年春二月朔〖1〗，日有食之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"shaodi-q-o038","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3bbeae9cc7c166f78514","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，散骑常侍、谏议大夫乂奏曰〖17〗：“礼：天子之宫，有斫砻之制〖18〗，无朱丹之饰。宜循礼复古。今天下已平，君臣之分明〖19〗。陛下但当不懈于位，平公正之心，审赏罚以使之。可绝后园习骑乘马，出必御辇乘车：天下之福，臣子之愿也。”晏、乂咸因缺以进规谏〖20〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
